  "description": "Welcome to Mealime – the game changer for busy individuals, couples, and families who desire healthy meals without the fuss. With over 7 million users adopting healthier, stress-free lifestyles, it's time you join the revolution too. \n\nSimplify meal planning, reduce food waste, save money and transform your lifestyle with Mealime. Personalize your meal plan for unique tastes and dietary preferences. Mealime is a better way to grocery shop Our recipes become a grocery list that you can even have delivered – Meal kit convenience at grocery store prices! A healthy, delicious meal is just 30 minutes away.\n\nKey Features and Benefits:\n\n1. Stress-free Grocery Shopping: Create a new meal plan and we'll auto-generate a grocery list for all your weekly needs. Shop in-store with your iPhone or finish your grocery shopping from your phone within minutes. Supported by leading grocery retailers.\n\n2. Quick, Healthy Meals: Streamline your cooking experience with our hassle-free, step-by-step instructions. Prepare meals swiftly and say goodbye to overlooked ingredients or cookware.\n\n3. Eliminate Decision Fatigue: Get a weekly personalized meal plan with simple and healthy recipes. Say goodbye to the daunting \"What should I eat?\" after a long day and cook a delicious meal quicker than ordering takeout.\n\n4. Personalized Meal Plans: Our personalization options surpass any other minimal-waste meal planner. Cater to your diet preferences from classic, flexitarian, pescetarian, to low carb, paleo, keto, vegetarian, vegan, gluten-free, dairy-free and more. Your meal plans, uniquely yours.\n\n5. Save Money, Reduce Waste: Don’t let your groceries go bad. Our intelligent meal plans aim to eliminate food waste, potentially saving you hundreds of dollars per year.\n\n6. Track Nutrition Goals: Each recipe provides comprehensive nutrition information. Integrated with the Health app, all your health information is easily accessible in one place!\n\nPricing & Terms for Meal Planner Pro:\nDownload Mealime for free. Opt for Mealime Meal Planner Pro at $2.99 USD/month for added benefits. Subscription renews automatically unless cancelled 24 hours before the end of the subscription period.\n\nPayment will be charged to your credit card via your iTunes account upon purchase confirmation. Your iTunes account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.\n\nManage subscriptions and turn off auto-renewal in Account Settings in iTunes post-purchase. Refunds not provided for unused portion of term.\n\nNo cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during active subscription period. Unused portions of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited upon subscription purchase.\n\nTerms of Use: http://mealime.com/terms-of-service/\nPrivacy Policy: http://mealime.com/privacy-policy/",
